TEMECULA, CA — real local knowledge. Drop it in naturally, never info-dump.

GEOGRAPHY: Southwest Riverside County. ~60mi north of San Diego, ~90mi southeast of LA. Santa Ana Mountains east, Santa Margarita River gorge south, wine country east along Rancho California Rd. Neighbors: Murrieta (north), Wildomar + Lake Elsinore (NW), Fallbrook (south), Menifee (NE), Pechanga Reservation (south).

ROADS: Rancho California Rd, Temecula Pkwy, Winchester Rd, Jefferson Ave, Ynez Rd, Margarita Rd, Nicolas Rd, Pauba Rd, Butterfield Stage Rd, De Portola Rd, Anza Rd, Old Town Front St, Diaz Rd, Overland Dr, Redhawk Pkwy, Wolf Store Rd.

HOODS: Old Town, Redhawk, Wolf Creek, Paloma del Sol, Roripaugh Ranch, Paseo del Sol, Harveston, Morgan Hill, Vail Ranch, Temeku Hills, Chardonnay Hills, Crowne Hill, Glenoak Hills, La Cresta, De Luz.

